	(text "Both USB muxes remain powered when modem/SoC are off. Hardware AND requires valid host\nand delayed modem rails before enabling data. U1903 releases after 180–420ms of valid VCC.\nHost TX -> module RX (37P/35N). Module TX (31P/29N) -> host RX. Module contains TX capacitors.\nNo M.2 PCIe routing: dedicated SoC PCIe port serves Ethernet. USB3 eye/jitter/loss and rail-fall\nisolation timing require measurement; capture/ERC does not establish recovery or throughput."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
